      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it doesn\u0027t work in the latest patchset (TH failed), because you\u0027re now calling ParcelFileDescriptor#close, which will make FileDescriptor#valid return false, so the task won\u0027t run.\n\nAnd previously it probably worked because a FD_ERROR event was fired, and #valid didn\u0027t actually check anything (since the fd was detached from the ParcelFileDescriptor when closing). But that means it didn\u0027t actually wait for the delay.\n\nThat\u0027s my theory at least ^^\u0027",
